{"text": "2. Now, we need to use 7 and 13 to get 24.", "start": 144, "end": 186, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "We can achieve this by multiplying 7 and (13/13 - 7) .", "start": 187, "end": 241, "label": "inform"}
